        "original_id": "ef7608b3-df84-548d-8768-460b2ff2ab51",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Our Kid Eh, Kid A\n- People: Mark Radcliffe, Marc Riley\n- Organizations: The Shirehorses, BBC Radio 1, Radiohead, Parlophone\n- Concepts: spoof bands, UK Albums Chart\n\nFacts:\n- Our Kid Eh is the second album by The Shirehorses.\n- The Shirehorses comprised BBC Radio 1 DJs Mark Radcliffe and Marc Riley, who were also known as Mark and Lard.\n- Kid A is the fourth studio album by the English rock band Radiohead.\n- Kid A was released on 2 October 2000 by Parlophone.\n- The title Our Kid Eh is a play on the title of Radiohead's album Kid A.\n- Our Kid Eh reached number 20 on the UK Albums Chart.",
